{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1002_null", "source_sha256": "85d2030f322f42ec37c6f9ffaa05958153deaabde1337960e22490a231f035b3", "ja": "■ロゴ表示（テキスト無し）■", "zh": "■显示标志（无文本）■", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "68d3b8c7bf79937250b6c6b09033a6e725bb5f544d3d22da8b650768711ce8a5", "ja": "さあ、御覧なさい。\n私の美しき絶望の花を！", "zh": "来，看看吧。\n我那美丽的绝望之花！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "ce253814bdb1d1dcc97f59855383d1402d4e6b543ab6e3c347793a93562a086d", "ja": "あれは、タウンズビルの悪魔……！\nやめてぇぇぇぇぇっ！！", "zh": "那是，小镇村的恶魔……！\n住手啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "75fa8cde966b87caa6fd2905cb98599025343e9de9e3c724edb6964d740b476c", "ja": "こ～んなところに隠れてたんだ？\n出ておいで、遊んであげるからぁ！", "zh": "原来你藏在这种地方啊？\n出来吧，我陪你玩嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7907aabb26f77f02b7c1f463000f66500a30e90cf8dd986653e1f22926b28d08", "ja": "アタシのダンスタイムは終わったんだ。\nもう……踊れないんだよ！", "zh": "我的舞蹈时间已经结束了。\n已经……跳不动了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "d2230834629bb9b01878f59bb35b84759a99f62dfb6992ada21141b93498d6a1", "ja": "でもアユムちゃんのソードは、まだ輝いてる！\n私にはわかるよ！　だって、ずっと見ていたから！", "zh": "可是步的剑还在闪耀！  \n我看得出来！因为我一直都在看着它啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "23bf58f6f0e30ea4ec6b91f87a8c3a89db59f15a8509b64fe8ea4ae72a0c6f9b", "ja": "いらっしゃい。\n戦いは適合率だけで決まらないことを教えてあげる。", "zh": "来吧。\n就让我来告诉你，战斗可不仅仅取决于契合率。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "4031f4e8c91d6f3b70c3d27fb41033866da746cd088b09d52653135be23f017e", "ja": "そして、わきまえて！\n貴女に世界は救えない！！", "zh": "还有，认清自己的立场！\n你是救不了世界的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "65bf0aaf7954d97f4f22aba9e2496df29f3a33b254c21cdedad3cf2ffb84eb9a", "ja": "私に救えなくても！\n私たちなら、戦えます！　だから！！", "zh": "即使我无法拯救！只要我们一起，就能战斗！所以！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "a19b51b966002bb63b3969dc5327af62c143d96f8c1509fbec5bc00094ae3c8b", "ja": "貴女だけでも、止めてみせる！\n未来を……護るためにっ！！", "zh": "就算只有你一个人，我也会阻止你！为了……守护未来！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "3b0d18c468cdc75525093b47da0be3704ead3e7953183024edc911c59eb90806", "ja": "『アイドル戦記ミリオンアーマーAce』近日公開！\n唸れ、ミリオンアーマー。爆ぜろ、ミリオンアーマー！", "zh": "《偶像战记 百万装甲Ace》近日公开！\n咆哮吧，百万装甲。爆发吧，百万装甲！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1013_045kar", "source_sha256": "261e80354b6f9914db963d2652202b5fe5a5908d9a700745cd7eaf9261fd53d9", "ja": "ほら、また一つ流れたわ。……生命（ひかり）が。\nウフフッ！", "zh": "看，又有一个流逝了。……生命（光）啊。\n呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7f62068464ff2d890a26cfe8deb2eb5664a4e689bbca8760923ebd46a8d8d828", "ja": "マイガー！　なにこのPV、超アツいんだけど！？", "zh": "我的天！这PV也太热血了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "bbda32ef9364b13c960823054e73c62b24746516d6f63e8dc0c28bc4ef6ce664", "ja": "だよねだよね、めっちゃいい感じ～！\n絶対みんな喜ぶやつじゃん♪", "zh": "对吧对吧，感觉超棒的～！\n绝对会让大家开心的嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1017_p", "source_sha256": "80dc97de4859696d14fd1b430a10f58837ee63adf9b95d0dec79babc4afc299f", "ja": "（今日はアイドル達が出演したSF映画、\n『ミリオンアーマーAce』の宣伝イベントだ）", "zh": "（今天是偶像们出演的科幻电影《百万装甲Ace》的宣传活动。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1018_052kao", "source_sha256": "36eb8897d7286b2e584841d894cbcbd3e88d98ccbd577882d70b04935937dbfe", "ja": "少しずつ撮ってもらったシーンが、こんなに素敵な\n映像になるなんて……感動しちゃいました！", "zh": "一点一点拍下来的镜头，竟然能变成这么棒的\n画面……我真的好感动啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "69d549685c9ce868ea6f0097f934aff50c197a5a0c86ea2594b6af58c232a2b2", "ja": "歌織さんや可憐、みんなの演技があってこそですよ。\n撮影、本当にお疲れさまでした。", "zh": "正是因为有歌织小姐、可怜，还有大家的精彩演技，才能拍出这样的影像。拍摄真的辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1020_004yuk", "source_sha256": "3f9119b242dceb43765e21cf4df8159961f7db083091ece658b1dcd76956921a", "ja": "可憐ちゃん、すごく頑張ってたよね。難しい役だったと\n思うけど、とってもかっこよかったですぅ。", "zh": "可怜真的很努力呢。虽然我觉得是个很难演的\n角色，但真的非常帅气哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "53fb042c759918f6019fbf3d720020852a7b9e5ff5e5c661decaa1f86885fdd3", "ja": "ほ、本当……？　か、かっこいい悪役として、\nちゃんとできてるか、ずっと不安だったけど……。", "zh": "真、真的吗……？我、我一直都很不安，不知道自己有没有好好演好这个帅气的反派……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "8d712a0ddd72f6b0996dfebe25020115ea9e8d7032eb9458899fe8aac4957b4f", "ja": "もしかしたら、少しは……できてたの、かな……？\nな、なんて……てへ♪", "zh": "说不定，我也稍微……演得还可以，吗……？\n开、开玩笑的啦……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1023_019min", "source_sha256": "c764c50078d3f3f007cced8cb1a3e4bd4cc2a128140132a2ad4ff56f5990e7b3", "ja": "少しじゃなくて、全部バッチリだったんじゃないかな！\nですよね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "何止是做得还可以，我觉得全都做得棒极了！\n对吧，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b7f00536c009418292ab1de27a6f4125b3eb383e8a5a64187c868927f53c9ca2", "ja": "ああ、可憐もみんなも、それぞれの役をしっかり掴んで\nくれていたと思う。監督さんも褒めてくれたしな！", "zh": "嗯，我觉得可怜和大家都已经牢牢抓住了各自的角色。导演也夸奖我们了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "db6eb3e26223781849772ff162530dbc21040bc9f5a4bd18e9755e6346f3ac04", "ja": "ふふっ。それもきっと、日頃からの\n{$P$}さんのご指導のおかげです♪", "zh": "呵呵，这肯定也多亏了平日里{$P$}先生的指导♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "8a9b4cb2e63a0d792d5a3ef7275ba263e45d5c67c5e1cc6781530af1d8a1123f", "ja": "あとこの衣装！　アーマーってわりに動きやすいん\nだよね～。アクションも思いっきりできるし♪", "zh": "还有这套服装！虽说是铠甲，但活动起来\n意外地轻松呢～。动作戏也能放开了演♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "a4edecd9ff473dce23aa3c5472bda1c1125e0814a4288261ea34e1aed1e9b048", "ja": "そうそう、アタシもバトルシーンでキレッキレの\nダンスができて、超満足って感じ！", "zh": "对对，我在战斗场景里也能跳出特别利落的舞蹈，感觉超满足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1028_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1336687df8db20127f2fa38e18f34679a4fc916d5fbf63d88fa63f1a3fb88d01", "ja": "ちょっぴり恥ずかしいんですけど、いろいろ踏ん切りも\nつくみたいで…私も、いつもより深い穴が掘れました！", "zh": "虽然有点不好意思，不过好像也能下定决心……我也挖出了比平时更深的洞！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "2224bb040479c3efdb7b4a9269d8b8de77a1c57b09810a60a73b81dbe34284ca", "ja": "もしかしたら、本当に体が強化されちゃうのかも♪\n特に歌織さんと可憐ちゃんのは最新型の設定だもんね！", "zh": "说不定身体真的会被强化呢♪\n特别是歌织小姐和可怜的，设定上可是最新型的嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "2c935bb6ed2c4b7141a541a6e8a4beb050f612249980c52a381e8c1d12c0b9a5", "ja": "あう。い、衣装は、私はまだ、自信がなくて……。\n私のせいで、地味になってないといいんですけど……。", "zh": "啊呜。服、服装的话，我还没有信心……  \n希望没有因为我而显得太朴素……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "fce45c3a43e7e5501daca3ff0be5a764afd1edf4da12759caa688bf0201d2190", "ja": "わ、私も……撮影だけならともかく、人前に出るには、\nちょっと……攻めすぎかなって……思わなくも……。", "zh": "我、我也……要只是拍摄的话倒还好，可要在人前亮相，我觉得……是不是有点……太大胆了……也不是没这么想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1032_p", "source_sha256": "771df5249d4241a0b73f23b538b6ac9c0fa02a38e185bf91b20779ea5728fc92", "ja": "いや、すみません。可憐と歌織さんの衣装は、設定的に\n機動性や適合率が優先されたことになっていて。", "zh": "不是，抱歉。按照设定，可怜和歌织小姐的服装是优先考虑机动性和适配率的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_135_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_135_ng_01_1033_p", "source_sha256": "a00551132aeafb2de540360d778519aa09929ff69fbc2a2d0ad5f3e57cb173c6", "ja": "しかも防御は超電磁シールド……という設定なので\nアーマーなのに装甲も薄くて……申し訳ないです。", "zh": "而且设定上防御是超电磁护盾……所以明明是装甲，防护层却很薄……真是抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
